    save the whole CsoundUnity object as a JSON in the Persistent Data Path\nS: to
    save only the Control channels as a JSON in the Persistent Data Path\nD: to Save
    a CsoundUnityPreset scriptable object in the Persistent Data Path\r\n    this
    can be used at runtime but it won't be loadable on a build\nL: to load the global
    preset saved before in the Persistent Data Path\nN: to read the text of the global
    preset JSON and then set the preset from the data read\nP: to load the CsoundUnityPreset
    from the JSON saved before in the Persistent Data Path\nO: to read the text of
    the global preset JSON and then set the preset from the data read\n"
